      "id": "claim_e6660ecf29ae44cc9815172eaa1693aa",
      "statement": "The three available complete base forms have materially different special-limit wording and amounts: the 2018 HO-3 uses a $250 money limit and $1,500 jewelry-theft limit, while the 2024 HO-3 uses $300 and $2,000 respectively, and the HO-6 has separately worded money, jewelry, firearm, watercraft, silverware, business-property, and vehicle-electronics categories.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://forms/HO/MS/HO-3/2018-09.md#L241-L256",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8c7a3e0896885c7451ff571d3362212e2c34dcc365296c8e78752f1f780d3787:"
