      "id": "claim_bb87c26a3294436e993939a92f409d47",
      "statement": "The HO-6 applies its Coverage C special limits to all covered property in the same loss regardless of number of insureds, claims, or items, before the deductible; the 2024 HO-3 applies special limits regardless of individual, joint, or benefit ownership and within Coverage C.",
