      "statement": "Coverage C cause-of-loss treatment differs by edition: the 2018 HO-3 lists its covered perils in Coverage C, the 2024 HO-3 requires direct physical loss caused by a policy-covered peril and subjects it to exclusions, and the HO-6 requires a named peril to directly cause the loss.",
